<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Chicago lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Chicago lowered.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said analyst Diane Glossman downgraded First Chicago NBD Corp to hold from buy after the shares reached Salomon's year-end 1997 price target of $57.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 at 57.</p>
</text>
